      "value": "@{5a9de400f3791b4155afcc5b|full_name}: this dont aply to this throw.\nquest fallback is hard becuse quest runs on android and is compiled in different ways. so you cant take a quest avatar and load it for pc user's.\nthis dont have that problem cuse all this will do is change out one avatar id to another based on people's safety settings.\nwill still take some work on the devs part but is doable.",
