      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Amazing idea, hopefully it can get more recognition.  Idk why the other people in the comments are arguing about it not being able to work acting like the concept of a fallback can only be applied to quest avatars lol.  I think the idea of having an individual performance ranking fallback for good, medium, etc is pretty redundant and you should only really need one that covers all the bases for PC.  Quest fallback of course has to be separate.",
      "viewerReactions": null
